      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "986. 化简：",
        "а) $(10-7\\sqrt{2})^2+(10+7\\sqrt{2})^2$；",
        "б) $(\\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{5}+3\\sqrt{2})^2-(3\\sqrt{2}-\\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{5})^2$；",
        "в) $(1+\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3})(1+\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3})$；",
        "г) $(1-\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{3})(1+\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{3})$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "987",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "987. 求下列各式的值：",
        "а) $\\frac{1}{11-2\\sqrt{30}}-\\frac{1}{11+2\\sqrt{30}}$； б) $\\frac{5}{3+2\\sqrt{2}}+\\frac{5}{3-2\\sqrt{2}}$；",
        "в) $\\frac{\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3}}$； г) $\\frac{11+\\sqrt{21}}{11-\\sqrt{21}}+\\frac{11-\\sqrt{21}}{11+\\sqrt{21}}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "988",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "988. 证明下列等式成立：",
        "а) $\\frac{(2+\\sqrt{3})^2-1}{(\\sqrt{3}+1)^2}=\\sqrt{3}$； б) $\\frac{(3+\\sqrt{5})^2-4}{(\\sqrt{5}+1)^2}=\\sqrt{5}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "989",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "989. 化简下列各式，并求它们的值：",
        "а) $\\frac{(\\sqrt{a}+\\sqrt{b})^2-b}{\\sqrt{ab}+2b}$，设$a=5$，$b=2$；",
        "б) $\\frac{(\\sqrt{x}-\\sqrt{y})^2+4\\sqrt{xy}}{x+\\sqrt{xy}}$，设$x=0.4$，$y=0.6$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "990",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "990. 化简：",
        "а) $\\sqrt{\\frac{a+\\sqrt{a^2-1}}{a-\\sqrt{a^2-1}}}$，其中$a\\geqslant1$； б) $\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sqrt{b^2+1}-b}{\\sqrt{b^2+1}+b}}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "991",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "991. 证明下列等式成立：",
        "а) $\\sqrt{13-4\\sqrt{3}}=2\\sqrt{3}-1$；",
        "б) $\\sqrt{13+4\\sqrt{3}}\\cdot\\sqrt{13-4\\sqrt{3}}=11$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
